  partName: Center Valve Cover Gasket
  description: The Center Valve Cover Gasket is a tiny, thin-flat component located
    at the top-center-center of the engine, sealing the valve cover to prevent oil
    leaks. Made of Frame material, this gasket is vital for maintaining the engine's
    performance and preventing damage. An interesting detail about the Center Valve
    Cover Gasket is that its central position allows it to provide an even seal around
    the valve cover, ensuring optimal engine performance.
  audioExplanation: {fileID: 0}
